00:07:17,142 --> 00:07:23,142
Samsara is a documentary film directed by Ron Fricke.

2
00:14:34,285 --> 00:14:40,285
Filmed over nearly five years in twenty-five countries on five continents, and shot on seventy-millimetre film, Samsara
transports us to the varied worlds of sacred grounds, disaster zones, industrial complexes, and natural wonders.

